 "url": "https://asurascans.com/comics/the-academy-s-weapon-replicator-05c7df14/chapter/1",
 "slices": 87,
 "targets": 190,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "s1-box_4774d42554514cf2",
   "slice": 1,
   "text": "ASURASCANS.COM"
  },
  {
   "id": "s1-box_32bdb4d18d6b4ff5",
   "slice": 1,
   "text": "只力ぱス"
  },
  {
   "id": "s1-box_797b9cecfdf84f30",
   "slice": 1,
   "text": "PR YUZU"
  },
  {
   "id": "s1-box_0b2c640929734e7c",
   "slice": 1,
   "text": "TSONE"
  },
  {
   "id": "s1-box_7295463d65d1496d",
   "slice": 1,
   "text": "RDONE"
  },
  {
   "id": "s1-box_14e646c62b604ff1",
   "slice": 1,
   "text": "Join Our Discord\nAsura.gg/discord"
  },
  {
   "id": "s4-box_9480ced184114197",
   "slice": 4,
   "text": "O BALDUR, WHO\nGOVERNS JUSTICE\nAND LIGHT..."
  },
  {
   "id": "s5-box_722e0207daab4b8e",
   "slice": 5,
   "text": "PLEASE,\nGRANTME\nSTRENGTH...!!!"
  },
  {
   "id": "s8-box_2c98cb65eca14822",
   "slice": 8,
   "text": "GAH!!"
  },
  {
   "id": "s9-box_afae8d495b34448b",
   "slice": 9,
   "text": "Z-ZO.:"
  },
  {
   "id": "s10-box_38b051b8cd6b411b",
   "slice": 10,
   "text": "IT CAN'T\nEND..."
  },
  {
   "id": "s10-box_9f0bb8d1cd2e4a3a",
   "slice": 10,
   "text": "50\nPOINTLESSLY.."
  },
  {
   "id": "s10-box_506ac5831647486f",
   "slice": 10,
   "text": "GAMEOVER"
  },
  {
   "id": "s11-box_6506529e14c54e42",
   "slice": 11,
   "text": "THASH\nGAME!!!"
  },
  {
   "id": "s11-box_87cbbf3411194995",
   "slice": 11,
   "text": "ASURASCANS.COM"
  },
  {
   "id": "s12-box_f8fe24205aec4fb8",
   "slice": 12,
   "text": "\"ETIUS.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "s13-box_4eb977ad9943433c",
   "slice": 13,
   "text": "AGAME OF SWORDS\nAND MAGIC, GOOS AND\nMONSTERS."
  },
  {
   "id": "s14-box_8d3b4e57972b432c",
   "slice": 14,
   "text": "WITH ITS LIFELIKE AI,\nVAST OPEN WORLD,"
  },
  {
   "id": "s14-box_6c71a9e853c44d52",
   "slice": 14,
   "text": "COMPELLING\nCHARACTERS, AND\nENDLESS CONTENT,"
  },
  {
   "id": "s15-box_14668956b64d4673",
   "slice": 15,
   "text": "IT WON SUCH HIGH\nPRAISE THAT PEOPLE\nSAID IT HAD CREATED\nAN ENTIRE WORLD"
  },
  {
   "id": "s16-box_8de6e0501da149a0",
   "slice": 16,
   "text": "BUTIT SOON BECAME A\nSHITSHOW THAT EVERY\nPLAYERABANDONED."
  },
  {
   "id": "s16-box_ae5375b1dbb247bb",
   "slice": 16,
   "text": "THEREASON?ITS\nBRUTAL DIFFICULTY."
  },
  {
   "id": "s17-box_aaa4e84d68384009",
   "slice": 17,
   "text": "AND YOU'D ENTER AREAS\nWHERE EVEN TRASH MOBS\nARE HARD TO KILL."
  },
  {
   "id": "s17-box_2e90f4c3e4f143d7",
   "slice": 17,
   "text": "NO MATTER WHICH ROUTE\nYOU TOOK, THEPROTAGONIST\nALWAYS DIED."
  },
  {
   "id": "s18-box_f1e8155fa8844fda",
   "slice": 18,
   "text": "NOT A SINGLE ETIUS\nPLAYER HAD EVER SEEN AN\nENDING OTHER THAN THE\nPROTAGONIST'S DEATH."
  },
  {
   "id": "s18-box_0f1a537e5b004448",
   "slice": 18,
   "text": "oo(235.9)\nWHAT A WASTE OF TIME."
  },
  {
   "id": "s19-box_3106df94e49144e6",
   "slice": 19,
   "text": "oo(123.45)\nARE THE DEVS EVER GONNA PUT OUT A BALANCE PATCH?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s19-box_011861ecf38044c5",
   "slice": 19,
   "text": "oo(111.222)\nTHE SMART ONES QUIT FIRST."
  },
  {
   "id": "s19-box_395908a5f96d4afe",
   "slice": 19,
   "text": "00(34.5)\nLMA000"
  },
  {
   "id": "s19-box_8bd5f8334aff4d64",
   "slice": 19,
   "text": "IT WAS AS IF THE\nCOMPANY HAD MADE\nTHE GAMEIMPOSSIBLE\nTO BEAT..."
  },
  {
   "id": "s19-box_582584f4b2c949da",
   "slice": 19,
   "text": "BUT I COULDN'T GIVE\nUP SO EASILY."
  },
  {
   "id": "s19-box_5bbfc1b3035a4035",
   "slice": 19,
   "text": "VE A FUTURE?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s19-box_b0256c9415114369",
   "slice": 19,
   "text": "REPORT"
  },
  {
   "id": "s19-box_601b66496eb74128",
   "slice": 19,
   "text": "GEMENT'S FUCKED UP.\nING US AND PLAYING MIND GAMES\nTHIS GAME EVEN HAVE A FUTURE?\nTE, BUT I'M TRYING TO GET OUT\nISTILL CAN"
  },
  {
   "id": "s20-box_acc2da856a4a474c",
   "slice": 20,
   "text": "NO, BUT...\nIF THERE HAVEN'T\nBEEN ANY BALANCE\nPATCHES..."
  },
  {
   "id": "s20-box_d1176710e5694236",
   "slice": 20,
   "text": "ASURASCANS.COM"
  },
  {
   "id": "s21-box_8139597108de4649",
   "slice": 21,
   "text": "THERE MUST\nBE A WAY TO\nBEAT IT."
  },
  {
   "id": "s21-box_4778970286ad4286",
   "slice": 21,
   "text": "CAUGHT UP IN THAT\nFUTILE BELIEF,"
  },
  {
   "id": "s22-box_1f3228697c274459",
   "slice": 22,
   "text": "I KEPT CLINGING TO A\nGAME EVERYONE ELSE\nHAD LEFT BEHIND..."
  },
  {
   "id": "s22-box_6af688b62aa64913",
   "slice": 22,
   "text": "ONLY TO UTTERLY\nFAIL MY VERY LAST\nATTEMPT JUST NOW."
  },
  {
   "id": "s22-box_e7b741a18d554c21",
   "slice": 22,
   "text": "...EVEN\nTHAT DIDN'T\nWORK?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s23-box_65fa97d6fd5f4873",
   "slice": 23,
   "text": "IS THERE EVEN A\nWAY TO BEAT THIS?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s24-box_3135f40bb35b4719",
   "slice": 24,
   "text": "AM I REALLY GOING TO\nFINISH WITHOUT CLEARING\nANYTHING?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s25-box_f6d05f8479b84c2d",
   "slice": 25,
   "text": "YEAH, THERE'S NO\nPOINT STICKING WITH\nTHIS SHITTY GAME."
  },
  {
   "id": "s25-box_cdf7ac4489ce4e29",
   "slice": 25,
   "text": "ASURASCANS.COM"
  },
  {
   "id": "s26-box_970c9b95706b4123",
   "slice": 26,
   "text": "TIME TO\nMOVE ON TO\nA NEW ONE."
  },
  {
   "id": "s26-box_6318c03ae53442c9",
   "slice": 26,
   "text": "THAT NEW\nRELEASE..."
  },
  {
   "id": "s26-box_451a03a220a445a1",
   "slice": 26,
   "text": "YOUNG\nMAN?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s26-box_0134e506b43d4efe",
   "slice": 26,
   "text": "...YOUNG\nMAN."
  },
  {
   "id": "s27-box_f9a6eb1f2901486c",
   "slice": 27,
   "text": "FRONDIER."
  },
  {
   "id": "s27-box_eb30a69376364e02",
   "slice": 27,
   "text": "FRONDIER\nDEROAH!"
  },
  {
   "id": "s28-box_2b10c014bf8f4d83",
   "slice": 28,
   "text": "F-F-FRONDIER?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s28-box_0430eed93a4e4788",
   "slice": 28,
   "text": "WERE YOU\nTALKING TO\nME?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s28-box_83c8b49ad8694bb1",
   "slice": 28,
   "text": "snicker"
  },
  {
   "id": "s28-box_3ac01b2208a2490b",
   "slice": 28,
   "text": "And.\nthere that that\nbastard goes."
  },
  {
   "id": "s28-box_add7d78bbe6f4438",
   "slice": 28,
   "text": "He's hopeless."
  },
  {
   "id": "s29-box_4bdbf77eb6ca443a",
   "slice": 29,
   "text": "OF COURSE\nI WAS."
  },
  {
   "id": "s29-box_86087bbaed904275",
   "slice": 29,
   "text": "IS THERE\nANOTHER FRONDIER\nIN THIS CLASS?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s30-box_af960502c0b6417c",
   "slice": 30,
   "text": "THIS IS\nTHE WEAPON THAT\nKILLED BALDUR."
  },
  {
   "id": "s30-box_32e42ed2cf0f4821",
   "slice": 30,
   "text": "TELL ME\nITS NAME."
  },
  {
   "id": "s31-box_76dd562c3eea4415",
   "slice": 31,
   "text": "THAT'S..."
  },
  {
   "id": "s32-box_f1abadb3cc6f4a61",
   "slice": 32,
   "text": "COUNTLESS GODS APPEAR\nIN NORSE MYTHOLOGY."
  },
  {
   "id": "s33-box_b0db415f5a7f4aba",
   "slice": 33,
   "text": "AMONGTHOSE\nMANYGODS,"
  },
  {
   "id": "s34-box_78437ebb14fe4e62",
   "slice": 34,
   "text": "ONE IS CONSIDERED\nTHE MOST PERFECT\nOFALL:"
  },
  {
   "id": "s34-box_d9dd12ce65e94d1b",
   "slice": 34,
   "text": "BALDUR,\nTHEGODOF\nLIGHT."
  },
  {
   "id": "s36-box_9eec80a3722c41e2",
   "slice": 36,
   "text": "HOWEVER,\nBALDUR DIES WHEN\nHE'S PIERCED BY\nMISTILTEINN."
  },
  {
   "id": "s36-box_ed570151c60c44dd",
   "slice": 36,
   "text": "MISTILTEINN MEANS\nMISTLETOE."
  },
  {
   "id": "s37-box_73196e70526c47e4",
   "slice": 37,
   "text": "FRONDIER?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s38-box_5c75adff4f8c4628",
   "slice": 38,
   "text": "MISTILTEINN\nKILLED BALDUR,\nBUT..."
  },
  {
   "id": "s38-box_23ff252f16384119",
   "slice": 38,
   "text": "THAT'S JUST\nAN ORDINARY\nBRANCH."
  },
  {
   "id": "s40-box_6c75d3b1b3cc459c",
   "slice": 40,
   "text": "THE MOMENT I\nANSWERED ON REFLEX,\nIREALIZED."
  },
  {
   "id": "s41-box_fcb52e4e913d4e1f",
   "slice": 41,
   "text": "FRONDIER WAS THE\nNAME OF A CHARACTER\nIN ETIUS..."
  },
  {
   "id": "s41-box_cabd147a2d8041b0",
   "slice": 41,
   "text": "AN ORDINARY\nBRANCH?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s42-box_c05e218de0ab4405",
   "slice": 42,
   "text": "WERE YOU\nDREAMING IN\nCLASS?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s42-box_7fc5293013c3464c",
   "slice": 42,
   "text": "...AND I WASN'T AT\nHOMEANYMORE."
  },
  {
   "id": "s43-box_3f88c03c84c34a79",
   "slice": 43,
   "text": "I WAS AT THE SCHOOL\nINSIDE THE GAME."
  },
  {
   "id": "s45-box_431c5f37d9004fa1",
   "slice": 45,
   "text": "IT'S BEEN A WEEK SINCEI\nLANDED IN ETIUS, THE GAME\nTHAT GAVE ME SO MUCH\nTROUBLE."
  },
  {
   "id": "s45-box_3a76497b9f7d49dc",
   "slice": 45,
   "text": "TIME FLIES..."
  },
  {
   "id": "s46-box_3453b1f86c8541d8",
   "slice": 46,
   "text": "THAT DAY'S LESSON\nWAS ABOUT THE GOD\nBALDUR."
  },
  {
   "id": "s46-box_ab3f6e9f67a54526",
   "slice": 46,
   "text": "THE SON OF ODIN\nAND GOD OF LIGHT,"
  },
  {
   "id": "s46-box_0ac214486d0f405f",
   "slice": 46,
   "text": "HE DIES WHEN\nHE'S PIERCED BY\nMISTILTEINN."
  },
  {
   "id": "s47-box_1af50b2141814d36",
   "slice": 47,
   "text": "A WEAPON THE\nPROTAGONIST WILL\nONE DAY WIELD."
  },
  {
   "id": "s48-box_16c8a1787a24401d",
   "slice": 48,
   "text": "BUT WHAT THE\nTEACHER SHOWED US ON\nTHE WIZAVIEW*.."
  },
  {
   "id": "s48-box_388d45f7ffb0487b",
   "slice": 48,
   "text": ".WASN'T MISTILTEINN. IT\nWAS AN ORDINARY BRANCH."
  },
  {
   "id": "s48-box_2dbe16632eb74127",
   "slice": 48,
   "text": "magitechdevice\nthat projectsimages in\nmidair."
  },
  {
   "id": "s48-box_174736061c904fa0",
   "slice": 48,
   "text": "I KNOW WHAT\nANSWER SHE WANTS, BUT\nTHAT'S JUST A SPRIG OF\nMISTLETOE."
  },
  {
   "id": "s49-box_7d137aaf4f4f4fdb",
   "slice": 49,
   "text": "APPARENTLY,\nAT THIS POINT,"
  },
  {
   "id": "s49-box_f92ab5efba34467e",
   "slice": 49,
   "text": "THE TRUE IDENTITY\nOF MISTILTEINN HASN'T\nBEEN REVEALED YET."
  },
  {
   "id": "s49-box_491f9a648b8e4a56",
   "slice": 49,
   "text": "ASURASCANS.COM"
  },
  {
   "id": "s49-box_560e1d1ee1b748c7",
   "slice": 49,
   "text": "I DIDN'T EXPECT\nTHEM TO LOOK AT\nME LIKE I WAS SO\nPATHETIC..."
  },
  {
   "id": "s50-box_e2fd131f37224f4b",
   "slice": 50,
   "text": "PART OF THE REASON\nPEOPLE LOOK AT FRONDIER\nTHIS WAY..."
  },
  {
   "id": "s50-box_e74439d14ad04512",
   "slice": 50,
   "text": "...MUST BE HIS\nINCREDIBLY LAZY\nATTITUDE."
  },
  {
   "id": "s51-box_aff678aa38f74065",
   "slice": 51,
   "text": "He's asleep\nagain."
  },
  {
   "id": "s51-box_e7365939aec84af8",
   "slice": 51,
   "text": "Isn't it\namazing that he\nstill shows up to\nevery class?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s51-box_fe8a9682e48d45c3",
   "slice": 51,
   "text": "What is he,\na sloth?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s51-box_3261a444495d4727",
   "slice": 51,
   "text": "THEY EVEN CALL\nHIM THE\"HUMAN\nSLOTH.\" THAT\nSAYS IT ALL.\nSlow~"
  },
  {
   "id": "s52-box_3600faaa4f6a4f0c",
   "slice": 52,
   "text": "BUT NOW, I CAN\nUNDERSTAND WHY\nHE'S SO LAZY..."
  },
  {
   "id": "s53-box_5e19eb7b10774abc",
   "slice": 53,
   "text": "CHARACTERINFO"
  },
  {
   "id": "s53-box_b91b2dd4c98b4931",
   "slice": 53,
   "text": "·NAME\nFRONDIER DE ROAH\n·AGE\n17"
  },
  {
   "id": "s53-box_f8de75f43fb144e9",
   "slice": 53,
   "text": "·AFFILIATION\nSECOND SON OF HOUSE ROAH\nFIRST-YEAR STUDENT OF\nCONSTELLE\n· DIVINE POWER\nNONE"
  },
  {
   "id": "s53-box_66deaa6b69d24b7f",
   "slice": 53,
   "text": "·DIVINE POWER\nNONE"
  },
  {
   "id": "s53-box_71002602c9a34e25",
   "slice": 53,
   "text": "FABRICATION"
  },
  {
   "id": "s53-box_0116a11a038c4d05",
   "slice": 53,
   "text": "UNIQUE GRADE"
  },
  {
   "id": "s53-box_ab1b902da72148ef",
   "slice": 53,
   "text": "•DESCRIPTION"
  },
  {
   "id": "s53-box_2cec66ec0bcb4998",
   "slice": 53,
   "text": "STORES AND REPLICATES\nTHE IMAGE OF AN OBJECT.\nHOWEVER, THE REPLICA IS\nMERELY AN ILLUSION.\nUSES THE PROCESSES\nOF\"REPLICATION\"AND\n\"WORKSHOP.\""
  },
  {
   "id": "s54-box_f3505515054f4c16",
   "slice": 54,
   "text": "MAINQUEST"
  },
  {
   "id": "s54-box_754d68e9e2fe47a6",
   "slice": 54,
   "text": "• TITLE\nCHANGE OF FATE"
  },
  {
   "id": "s54-box_6f6d5f5dbceb4480",
   "slice": 54,
   "text": "DESCRIPTION"
  },
  {
   "id": "s54-box_abd890ccd4514bf5",
   "slice": 54,
   "text": "YOU KNOW THE FATE THAT\nAWAITS HUMANITY.. THE DAY\nIT WILL MEET ITS END."
  },
  {
   "id": "s54-box_b1f8593385ed4fa3",
   "slice": 54,
   "text": "SAVE HUMANITY AND\nCHANGE ITS DESTINY."
  },
  {
   "id": "s55-box_e7a535298c4b4e48",
   "slice": 55,
   "text": "I'M SUPPOSED TO\nSAVE HUMANITY..."
  },
  {
   "id": "s55-box_a13feefb38414ec5",
   "slice": 55,
   "text": "..WITH STATS\nTHIS SHITTY?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s55-box_1cc479263de349bc",
   "slice": 55,
   "text": "HOW THE HELL\nAM I SUPPOSED\nTO BEAT THIS?!"
  },
  {
   "id": "s56-box_ed3b34e4ecb144b4",
   "slice": 56,
   "text": "DIVINE POWER."
  },
  {
   "id": "s56-box_d6ef0b7ea3a041ea",
   "slice": 56,
   "text": "POWER THAT GODS\nBESTOW UPON THEIR\nCHOSEN HUMANS,"
  },
  {
   "id": "s56-box_60dbbdf5ebf04f34",
   "slice": 56,
   "text": "FAR STRONGER THAN\nWHAT ANY SKILL OR MAGIC\nCAN MUSTER..."
  },
  {
   "id": "s57-box_134e4ebc444840bb",
   "slice": 57,
   "text": "BUT FRONDIER HAS\nNO DIVINE POWER."
  },
  {
   "id": "s57-box_c1b630b2c9ea4f2d",
   "slice": 57,
   "text": "ASURASCANS.COM"
  },
  {
   "id": "s57-box_92cf0074e9f240b1",
   "slice": 57,
   "text": "IN OTHER WORDS,\nNO GOD HAS CHOSEN\nHIM."
  },
  {
   "id": "s58-box_861d2a6975de43d9",
   "slice": 58,
   "text": "AND AS FOR\nWHETHER HIS SKILL\nIS ANY GOOD..."
  },
  {
   "id": "s59-box_1da7ccbc179043c2",
   "slice": 59,
   "text": "ACTIVATE\n[FABRICATION]-"
  },
  {
   "id": "s60-box_69b51a3bf2354573",
   "slice": 60,
   "text": "ITEMINFO"
  },
  {
   "id": "s60-box_ff335616b8644baf",
   "slice": 60,
   "text": "PREMETONCOMNORESUIA)"
  },
  {
   "id": "s60-box_4229eed8dd9f4403",
   "slice": 60,
   "text": "V\nCOMMON GRADE"
  },
  {
   "id": "s60-box_75f1b1c03c024ac5",
   "slice": 60,
   "text": "DESCRIPTION\nOCONNICOTCNIM"
  },
  {
   "id": "s60-box_173169652b014754",
   "slice": 60,
   "text": "A FABRICATED IMITATION\nOFAFOUNTAINPEN.\nIT HAS NO PHYSICAL SUBSTANCE."
  },
  {
   "id": "s61-box_3ec33c96dd1647f9",
   "slice": 61,
   "text": "ITLOOKS\nALMOST IDENTICAL\nTO THE ORIGINAL."
  },
  {
   "id": "s61-box_6d16e6ece6034512",
   "slice": 61,
   "text": "ASURASCANS.COM"
  },
  {
   "id": "s61-box_a8ac8d13559b4634",
   "slice": 61,
   "text": "IT SEEMS LIKE AN\nORDINARY FOUNTAIN\nPEN, BUT..."
  },
  {
   "id": "s62-box_dc7d2aacc50b4b3c",
   "slice": 62,
   "text": "IT CAN'T WRITE,"
  },
  {
   "id": "s62-box_552092557da845bc",
   "slice": 62,
   "text": "CAN'T PIERCE EVEN\nA SHEET OF PAPER,"
  },
  {
   "id": "s63-box_5457397b7acc40f5",
   "slice": 63,
   "text": "AND ONLY\nI CAN SEE IT."
  },
  {
   "id": "s64-box_efe2ef2a2ffe40b4",
   "slice": 64,
   "text": "AND ONLY\nI CAN SEE IT."
  },
  {
   "id": "s64-box_601f652a272149ea",
   "slice": 64,
   "text": "AN ILLUSION THAT\nCAN'T INTERACT WITH\nREALITY AT ALL."
  },
  {
   "id": "s64-box_a168f835690c4ee3",
   "slice": 64,
   "text": "THIS ISN'T A\nSKILL..."
  },
  {
   "id": "s65-box_06c953c028cd4a81",
   "slice": 65,
   "text": "ISN'T IT\nMORELIKEA\n\"DELUSION\"?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s66-box_1953534177dd4f57",
   "slice": 66,
   "text": "ASTHE\nQUEST SAYS,"
  },
  {
   "id": "s67-box_81fb8300bf3e41fd",
   "slice": 67,
   "text": "IKNOWHOW THIS\nGAMEENDS."
  },
  {
   "id": "s67-box_37e7adbeef764fde",
   "slice": 67,
   "text": "UNABLE TO\nSTOP THE FLOOD OF\nMONSTERS,"
  },
  {
   "id": "s68-box_5db612c6e0454285",
   "slice": 68,
   "text": "A FUTILE END."
  },
  {
   "id": "s69-box_0f1681623620448b",
   "slice": 69,
   "text": "JUST LIKE THE\nENDING I'VE SEEN\nCOUNTLESS TIMES."
  },
  {
   "id": "s70-box_fbae885e3beb4ab4",
   "slice": 70,
   "text": "ALL I'VE GOT\nIS ZERO DIVINE\nPOWER..."
  },
  {
   "id": "s70-box_5ab49cb8f1d94e59",
   "slice": 70,
   "text": "..AND A SKILL\nTHAT'S BASICALLY\nA DELUSION."
  },
  {
   "id": "s70-box_ee3365690e9f410b",
   "slice": 70,
   "text": "I COULDN'T EVEN\nBEAT THIS GAME AS\nTHE PROTAGONIST."
  },
  {
   "id": "s71-box_227fa483f8a34f4a",
   "slice": 71,
   "text": "WHAT KIND\nOF HARD MODE\nIS THIS?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s72-box_60581ee52cf543a5",
   "slice": 72,
   "text": "HARD MODE?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s73-box_347a2767f64941fd",
   "slice": 73,
   "text": "WH-WHEN\nDID YOU COME\nINP!"
  },
  {
   "id": "s73-box_7f7047d7fa174878",
   "slice": 73,
   "text": "JUST NOW."
  },
  {
   "id": "s73-box_172f2a6d78f540ee",
   "slice": 73,
   "text": "I KNOCKED,\nBUT YOU DIDN'T\nANSWER, SO I LET\nMYSELF IN."
  },
  {
   "id": "s74-box_aaf8735b1cce4fbf",
   "slice": 74,
   "text": "A LETTER\nHAS ARRIVED\nFOR YOU."
  },
  {
   "id": "s74-box_f27590d9de294699",
   "slice": 74,
   "text": "A LETTER?\nFROM WHO?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s75-box_a7290f2a7f3642a2",
   "slice": 75,
   "text": "LORD\nANGPER."
  },
  {
   "id": "s76-box_318e7290d005405b",
   "slice": 76,
   "text": "IF I HAD TO NAME THE TWO\nMOST FAMOUS MEMBERS\nOFHOUSEROAH."
  },
  {
   "id": "s76-box_acc530be3cc54098",
   "slice": 76,
   "text": "ASURASCANS.COM"
  },
  {
   "id": "s76-box_d6ef4dcb57994242",
   "slice": 76,
   "text": "THEYD BEGAPER DERDAH"
  },
  {
   "id": "s77-box_fcf19c4c6b60458b",
   "slice": 77,
   "text": "ANDHISELDEST\nSON, ATZIE."
  },
  {
   "id": "s78-box_a35870cededc4638",
   "slice": 78,
   "text": "ANGPER IS A\nSUPERHUMAN..."
  },
  {
   "id": "s78-box_2b57fb2693ae436e",
   "slice": 78,
   "text": "WHO HAS NEVER LET\nMONSTERS BREACH HIS\nDEFENSES, NOTEVEN\nONCE."
  },
  {
   "id": "s79-box_bc9d09c52be94648",
   "slice": 79,
   "text": "AND ATZIE INHERITED ALL\nOF HIS FATHER'S TALENT,"
  },
  {
   "id": "s79-box_c22ddbdecc524be0",
   "slice": 79,
   "text": "MAKING HIM A\nTRULY OVERPOWERED\nCHARACTER IN ETIUS."
  },
  {
   "id": "s79-box_218a7ca3af444b4b",
   "slice": 79,
   "text": "RIGHT, FRONDIER\nIS ANGPER'S SON\nTOO, ISN'T HE?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s80-box_bc9f1ea8e0b74692",
   "slice": 80,
   "text": "MAYBE\nI CAN GET SOME\nHELP--"
  },
  {
   "id": "s80-box_9986ed4c1e4a47b2",
   "slice": 80,
   "text": "Frondier, listen\ncarefully."
  },
  {
   "id": "s81-box_693cf1257f0c4d80",
   "slice": 81,
   "text": "I will no longer\ntolerate your\nlaziness."
  },
  {
   "id": "s81-box_22e9050d10ca476c",
   "slice": 81,
   "text": "Place in the\nacademy's top\nten overall."
  },
  {
   "id": "s81-box_92cbc9e2b2754b9f",
   "slice": 81,
   "text": "??"
  },
  {
   "id": "s82-box_48c449f9b0974802",
   "slice": 82,
   "text": "IF YOU\nDON'T, YOU'RE\nDISONWED."
  },
  {
   "id": "s82-box_adfb077dacf14945",
   "slice": 82,
   "text": "ASURASCANS.COM"
  },
  {
   "id": "s83-box_d9da77f31af046ee",
   "slice": 83,
   "text": "A SIDE QUEST HAS\nBEEN GENERATED."
  },
  {
   "id": "s83-box_2be3d9e631484bd6",
   "slice": 83,
   "text": "SKILLINFO"
  },
  {
   "id": "s83-box_4829d5a288ab4718",
   "slice": 83,
   "text": "TITLE\nFATHER'S ORDER"
  },
  {
   "id": "s83-box_bde3c568a2504cad",
   "slice": 83,
   "text": "ONGDER'S POTIENCE WITH"
  },
  {
   "id": "s84-box_63dc7a928437477f",
   "slice": 84,
   "text": "RENEDSSIZNESHAS"
  },
  {
   "id": "s84-box_600290d8ac044667",
   "slice": 84,
   "text": "PLACE IN CONSTEL'S TOP\nTEN OVERALL BY THE END\nOF THIS SEMESTER.\nREWARD"
  },
  {
   "id": "s84-box_a1e3965915fd4098",
   "slice": 84,
   "text": "GAN NPER'  ECOGNITION."
  },
  {
   "id": "s84-box_6333b4888d224fc4",
   "slice": 84,
   "text": "FAILURE WILL RESULT\nIN BEING DISOWNED."
  },
  {
   "id": "s85-box_fac2aa3841194fb5",
   "slice": 85,
   "text": "THAT\nMUCH..."
  },
  {
   "id": "s85-box_5ecf01a865dc4f35",
   "slice": 85,
   "text": "?"
  },
  {
   "id": "s86-box_1b027cb6542a436e",
   "slice": 86,
   "text": "I ALREADY\nKNOW!"
  },
  {
   "id": "s86-box_8fcad37200764b01",
   "slice": 86,
   "text": "IT LOOKS LIKE\nI'M TRAPPED IN A\nSHITTY GAME."
  },
  {
   "id": "s87-box_dd915b027d03495e",
   "slice": 87,
   "text": "早号\n333"
  },
